		"ja": [
			"公式外伝『機動戦士ガンダム 鉄血のオルフェンズ 月鋼』第2期の新たな主人公機がHG化！",
			"• 特徴的な左右非対称のデザインを新規パーツで再現！■「デモリッション・ナイフ」と合体し、大型武器への変形も可能な「バスタードチョッパー」や、大型手甲は新規造形！■サブアームは展開式でライフルを装備させることもできる！"
		],
		"en": [
			"The new main character machine of the second season of the official side story \"Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans Steel\" has been made into HG!",
			"• Reproduce the characteristic asymmetrical design with new parts! ■The \"Bastard Chopper\", which can be combined with the \"Demolition Knife\" and transformed into a large weapon, and the large gauntlet are newly sculpted! ■The sub-arm is expandable and can be equipped with a rifle!"
		]
